msgstr ""

#: ../../source/search-strategy-discovery_SKILL.md:13
msgid "The Problem"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/search-strategy-discovery_SKILL.md:14
msgid ""
"When a user says something is \"already configured\" or \"already set "
